{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心してください。今日もブログ更新しますよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！14回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りゅーやさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく明るい安村さん\nゴー☆ジャスさん\nスギちゃんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかお会いしたい芸人さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸を習いたいです。\nそれで一緒に全力でやりたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみさんと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野星野"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎのの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はクリスマスライブが\nあります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブが終わったばかりで\n余韻に浸っているし\n浸ってたいという気持ちもありますが\n次々と超えなきゃいけない壁が\n押し寄せてきているので\nとりあえず今年が終わるまで\nエンジン切らずに飛ばしていきたいと思います！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年に向けての\n今は助走3歩目くらいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I am fire"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の髪型\n外ハネにしよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきちと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日ぶりの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ひなたさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁最近我が家でカレー率高いのでカレーにオススメのトッピング教えてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎カレーはカレーとごはんをシンプルにそのまま食べるのが好きです！\nカレーにアレンジしたことがない！！！いつ食べても美味しいし、\n何日食べ続けてもあきない！！！\nカレーすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ぞうさんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁お米は柔らかめが好き？かためがすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎柔らかめがすき！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あやかさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは赤と青どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎赤も好きだけど、青の方が顔がはえるって着物屋さんで言われてから、青がすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆しょーとさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁東京とか千葉にはなかったおいしいもの、を教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎よくは食べてなかったけど、大人になってからの今は北海道に帰ると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必ずお赤飯を食べてます！\n北海道のお赤飯は小豆じゃなくて甘納豆なんだよ！本当にだいすき！\n甘納豆のお赤飯！北海道のお赤飯！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆くくさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁体育祭はなにやってました?\n自分は喉を潰すぐらい応援してました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎学ランを着て応援団もしてたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色別対抗リレーやクラス対抗リレーにも出てたよー！リレーばっかりでてたよー！走るのばっかりやってたよー！走るのばっかり気合いが入ってたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ベスビオさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁最近集めてるものある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ダッフィーとかシェリーメイとかジェラトーニのぬいぐるみ集めてるの！\nでも、まだダッフィー1匹とジェラトーニ1匹しかいないんだけどね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆カキーユさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃんとホリちゃんどちらが大食い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎最近は、私も負けないくらい食べるようになったと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、しかし\n伊藤かりん、渡辺みり愛など\n二期生にも限界を知らない大食いが\nたくさんいそうなので\nいつか対決してみたいな。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスとうなぎとわたあめなら負けない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ももさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁質問です！うちわにずっきゅんとかビームとか自分の武器以外のことが書いてあってもやってくれますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎もちろん！！！見つけたら、いつもやってるよ！！！この間はね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引き寄せて！っていう団扇を見つけたから、\n引き寄せるんだっ！！！ってやった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、今日のヒナコセレクト(仮)は以上で終了でーーーす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだヒナコセレクト募集してまーす！\nどんな質問や話でも大丈夫です！\n皆さんからのコメントの中から\nヒナコがセレクトして紹介します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日   12月20日 発売\n⇨ファッション＆カルチャーブック\n【 MIRROR 】創刊号"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀北コンビで載ってます！！！\n今日一足先に頂いたのですが\nものすごく素な2人がうつってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の写真でも見せたことのないくらいの\n2人にしか伝わらないような細かな素な感じがうつってます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MIRROR！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこせんべいを食べさせ合う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎえいご\nクリスマス60分スペシャル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月20日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22時～放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CS放送  TBSチャンネル1"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストに真夏さん生駒さん高山さんみなみさんが来て下さいました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に話した\n私が泣いてしまったあの部分が\nどうなっているか不安です。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いてる部分がカットされていて\nいきなり私が暗くなっていたら\nその後なんだな。。。と悟ってください。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく楽しい収録でした！\nぜひ、みなさん見てください！\nCS放送です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい。もう少し\nアンダーライブのこと考えさせて下さい。\nまとめてからブログを更新するか迷いましたが、まとまらないけど\nブログは更新したかったから\nこうなりました(；ω；)すみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/19/3710467/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで今日はこのへんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n8回目はうえむーさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr